#: c8e1f0244e0f40a587d897e1bf83c15f
msgid ""
"The Seagull MAP2 can be `purchased from Seagull UAV "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map2/>`__ and comes with a servo"
" cable included. The camera cables has to be purchased separately - please "
"use the `Cable Finder <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__ page"
" to determine which cable is needed."
msgstr ""
"Seagull MAP2 可从 `Seagull UAV <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-"
"map2/>`__ 购买，附带舵机连接线。相机数据线需另购——请使用 `数据线查找 <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-"
"cable-finder/>`__ 页面确定所需数据线。"

