"The :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` article explains how to configure Pixhawk AUX output as"
" a servo camera trigger."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` 一文介绍如何将 Pixhawk AUX 输出配置为舵机相机触发器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:61
#: 0d15111f89f84af3ac9ed199f41ae716 149dbabd2acb463e84c03183025ddcea
#: 1934b547ed924e928554617bcea26a5c 2b7696fb37cd48cfaf9237b5d3a48071
#: df09b4775560458eb4255e159b6243ba
msgid ""
"The parameters used to configure this particular hardware are listed below. "
"Note that you have to set different shutter pushed and duration values "
"depending on which mode you want to support for camera triggering."
msgstr "以下列出配置此特定硬件所用的参数。请注意，根据所需的相机触发模式，需设置不同的快门按下和持续时间值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:66
