msgstr "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``：0（Servo）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:67
#: 3b9bd49b048747a8a4e137cd8ee6a6b1 5b8092142132472a9c6b4a91484477c5
